{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/11010","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/11010/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/11010/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/11010/events","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/11010","id":1095546823,"node_id":"I_kwDOBlCVUc5BTLfH","number":11010,"title":"CoarseBackoffWaiter can get into a busy loop, ClientUnitTest.TestRetryFunc fails on aarch64","user":{"login":"mbautin","id":552936,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjkzNg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/552936?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin","html_url":"https://github.com/mbautin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbautin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1281039316,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjgxMDM5MzE2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/kind/failing-test","name":"kind/failing-test","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":"Tests and testing infra"},{"id":1290759928,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjkwNzU5OTI4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/area/docdb","name":"area/docdb","color":"0c4fcc","default":false,"description":"YugabyteDB core features"},{"id":1353907004,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzUzOTA3MDA0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/high","name":"priority/high","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"High Priority"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"es1024","id":6742815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDI4MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6742815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024","html_url":"https://github.com/es1024","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"es1024","id":6742815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDI4MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6742815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024","html_url":"https://github.com/es1024","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2022-01-06T17:47:39Z","updated_at":"2022-01-19T21:54:40Z","closed_at":"2022-01-19T21:54:40Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"@spolitov pointed out that ClientUnitTest.TestRetryFunc fails on aarch64:\r\n\r\n```\r\nNote: Google Test filter = ClientUnitTest.TestRetryFunc\r\n[==========] Running 1 test from 1 test case.\r\n[----------] Global test environment set-up.\r\n[----------] 1 test from ClientUnitTest\r\n[ RUN      ] ClientUnitTest.TestRetryFunc\r\nWARNING: Logging before InitGoogleLogging() is written to STDERR\r\nI0106 00:59:44.948076 50107 client-unittest.cc:192] num retries: 62\r\n../../src/yb/client/client-unittest.cc:194: Failure\r\nExpected: (counter) <= (8), actual: 62 vs 8\r\nTest failure stack trace:\r\n../../src/yb/client/client-unittest.cc:194:                                                             @           0x40d237  yb::client::ClientUnitTest_TestRetryFunc_Test::TestBody()\r\n[  FAILED  ] ClientUnitTest.TestRetryFunc (1284 ms)\r\n[----------] 1 test from ClientUnitTest (1284 ms total)\r\n\r\n[----------] Global test environment tear-down\r\n[==========] 1 test from 1 test case ran. (1284 ms total)\r\n[  PASSED  ] 0 tests.\r\n[  FAILED  ] 1 test, listed below:\r\n[  FAILED  ] ClientUnitTest.TestRetryFunc\r\n\r\n 1 FAILED TEST\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe retry loop works like so:\r\n```\r\nStatus RetryFunc(\r\n    CoarseTimePoint deadline,\r\n    const string& retry_msg,\r\n    const string& timeout_msg,\r\n    const std::function<Status(CoarseTimePoint, bool*)>& func,\r\n    const CoarseDuration max_wait) {\r\n  DCHECK(deadline != CoarseTimePoint());\r\n\r\n  CoarseBackoffWaiter waiter(deadline, max_wait);\r\n\r\n  if (waiter.ExpiredNow()) {\r\n    return STATUS(TimedOut, timeout_msg);\r\n  }\r\n  for (;;) {\r\n    bool retry = true;\r\n    Status s = func(deadline, &retry);\r\n    if (!retry) {\r\n      return s;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    VLOG(1) << retry_msg << \" attempt=\" << waiter.attempt() << \" status=\" << s.ToString();\r\n    if (!waiter.Wait()) {\r\n      break;\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return STATUS(TimedOut, timeout_msg);\r\n}\r\n```\r\nand the `Wait` function is implemented as:\r\n```\r\n  bool Wait() {\r\n    auto now = Clock::now();\r\n    if (ExpiredAt(now)) {\r\n      return false;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    NextAttempt();\r\n\r\n    std::this_thread::sleep_for(DelayForTime(now));\r\n    return true;\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn the test, we get way too many retries compared to what's expected.","closed_by":{"login":"es1024","id":6742815,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NDI4MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6742815?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024","html_url":"https://github.com/es1024","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/es1024/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/11010/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yu